&lt;p&gt;From: Florida, To: Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Milton, Illinois on June 21, 1911&lt;br&gt;
Picture Info: “Spooners Delight” Copyright 1908 by J. Thomas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Bess Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dear girlie,&lt;br&gt;
Am fine and dandy. Hope you are the same. Will be home Sunday I guess. Excuse writing.&lt;br&gt;
Florida&lt;/p&gt;</description>
